    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya kūpeelela Holebu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ūng'wīla ū Yezebeli pyī ī mihayo īyo akīyīta ū Eliya, nū mumo akababūlagīla na līlūshū pye a bahangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yezebeli ūtūma munhū ū kūlī Eliya kūhaya, “A bamulungu ni banitūlage hataale na kūtinda ho, ūlū īlashike hīkī ī ntondo, nasangwe nataalī kūwīta ū būpanga wako kūbiza gītī bo ng'wa ūmò wa bahangi benabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūbona apeele, iipīje ū būpanga bokwe; aho washika Beeli-sheba mu sī ya Yuda, ūneka henaho ū ntūmami wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ūja lūgendo lwa lūshikū lūgima ūkolobela mu gatī yitogolo; ūshika ha līntī lya kaniniigwe wigasha mu mbeho yalyo, ūlomba gīkī hambū hambū ache. Ūhaya, “Ee SEEBA, nigejaga lūūlū ī haha, nīngījage ū būpanga; nguno ū nene natī wawiza kūbaheeba a bakūlūgenji bane!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlaala ū mu mbeho ya ntī gwenūyo ūbītwa tūlo; kwimanīla malaika wankuumya ūng'wīla, “Bebe būkaga ūlye shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlola lola hoi ī gīkī, ūbona ngatī gookejiagwa ha makala ga moto, n'ibīlīka lya minzī ga kūng'wa; ī shenīsho shalī bbihī na a haaho walī atūūlile ū ntwe gwakwe. Ūsola ūlya, na a minzī ūng'wa, ūlaala hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika o ng'wa SEEBA wiza hangī lūkangala lwa kabīlī ūnkuumya ūng'wīla, “Būūkaga ūlye nguno ūlī na lūgendo lūlīhu no, lūkūkūheeba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūka ng'hana, ūlya nū kūng'wa ūng'wa. Ī shilīwa shenīsho shūng'winha nguzu ja kūshimīza lūgendo lwa shikū makūmi anè līīmi na būjikū, kūshisha ūshika kū lūgūlū lwa Holebu, lūgūlū lwa ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūng'wilongela Eliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika kwenūko wingīla ng'wihalo ūlaala ng'wenūmo ī būjikū; kwimanīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gwang'wizīīla gūlīmūja, “Ūlīta kī a henaha Eliya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Nalī na wiilu no kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa būdūla bose, nguno a Baisilaeli baalīlekile ī lilagane lyako, nī myalīlo yako bīsambaagūla, na a bahangi bako būbabūlaga. Naasaagile nene iyene dūhū, alīyo nū nene ī haha balībūkooba ū būpanga waane bawīnje!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Fumaga hanze ūkīmīīle ha lūgūlū, kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; nguno ū SEEBA alīhaya kūbīta.” Kwimanīla gwabūūka nyaga ntaale gwa nguzu, gūbīnzagūla mitī na kūpaanagūla mawe kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, alīyo ū SEEBA walī atīmo ū mu nyaga gwenūyo. Aho gwabīta ū nyaga yūding'himīla nyahīnga, alīyo ū SEEBA walī atīmo ū mu nyahīnga yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī nyahīnga gwiza moto, alīyo ū SEEBA walī atīmo nū mu moto gwenūyo. Gwahayūbīta ū moto, wigwa ilaka ikoonu līlīyomba mu būlembeezu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya aho waliigwa ī lilaka lyenīlo wifīkīja ng'wenda ū kū būshū wakwe; ūfuma hanze ūkīmīīla a ha nyango gwa kwingīlīla ū ng'wihalo. Hūna ilaka lyūnyombya līlīmūja, “Ūlīta kī ū kūūnū Eliya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Nalī na wiilu no kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA ū Mulungu wa būdūla bose, nguno a Baisilaeli baalīlekile ī lilagane lyako, nī myalīlo yako bīsambaagūla, na a bahangi bako būbabūlaga. Naasaagile nene iyene dūhū, alīyo nū nene ī haha balībūkooba ū būpanga wane bawīnje!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Shokaga ūbītīle ī nzīla īyo wizīīlile, ūje kwitogolo lya Damasiko; ūlū ūshika koi ūkūng'witīīla maguta Hazaeli abize ntemi wa Alamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma na Yehu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nimushi ūkūng'witīīla maguta abize ntemi wa Isilaeli; hanuma ya henaho ūkūng'witīīla maguta Elisha ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shafati muna Abeli-mehola, alabize ng'hangi a ha ng'wanya gwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehu akūmūlaga būlī ng'wene ūyo alalūpūlūgūke ū lūshū lwa ng'wa Hazaeli, ū wa kūlūpūlūgūka ū lūshū lwa ng'wa Yehu, Elisha akūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu Isilaeli balīmo banhū shihūmbī mpungatī, abo nabalekile bikale bapanga; a benabo balemile ū kūntugīja mazwi ū Baalī, nī milomo yabo ītaalī kūmbipa na hado yaya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwitanwa kwa ng'wa Elisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Eliya wīnga a henaho; ūmona Elisha ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shafati akūlīmaga na nzīkū jakwe makūmi abīlī n'inè jitungilwe majooki. Ū wei ng'wenekīlī walī kū numa hamò n'ibīlī jaho. Hūna ū Eliya ūbītīla haho bbihī, aho washika hoi ūgūsola ū ng'wenda gwakwe ūmponekeja ū Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūjileka ī nzīkū jakwe ūmpeeleela ū Eliya, ūshika ūng'wīla, “Nizunīlījage naje nakanage tame baba na mayū; nakwiza tūje hamò.” Ū Eliya ūnshokeja, “Shokaga dūhū ū bebe; ī gīsī naakwītīla mhayo kī ū nene?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūneka, ūshoka; ūshikīla kūjisīnza ī nzīkū jakwe, a majooki gajo ūgabbutagūla jūbiza ng'hwi ja kūjizugīla ī nyama; ūbinha banhū būlya. Hūna ūnkūūbīja ū Eliya ūūkabiza ntūmami wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
